<div class="welcome-page">
    <h1>
        <img src="~/icon.jpg">
        eShop Identity
    </h1>

    <ul>
        <li>
            The server publishes a
            <a href="~/.well-known/openid-configuration">discovery document</a>
            listing its endpoints, supported features and the location of its key material.
        </li>
        <li>
            Signing keys are published at
            <a href="~/.well-known/jwks">the JWKS endpoint</a>, which is how every API in eShop
            validates the tokens it receives without sharing a secret with this service.
        </li>
        <li>
            The OpenID Provider is
            <a href="https://github.com/Abblix/Oidc.Server">Abblix OIDC Server</a>.
        </li>
    </ul>
</div>
